      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 19:22",
        "textualBasisJa": "The border reached to Tabor, Shahazumah, and Beth Shemesh. Their border ended at the Jordan: sixteen cities with their villages."
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 19:23",
        "textualBasisJa": "This is the inheritance of the tribe of the children of Issachar according to their families, the cities with their villages."
